  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-water-table-mapping.\n\n- Generates groundwater level and depth-to-water rasters from discrete well observations via IDW or simplified Kriging interpolation.\n- Supports terrain constraints to ensure water table does not exceed surface elevation.\n- Includes leave-one-out cross-validation with RMSE, MAE, R\u00b2 metrics.\n- Provides outputs as GeoTIFF rasters and JSON reports.\n- Runs offline with support for both real and synthetic data.\n- All processing is local; no user data is uploaded.",
